# Remote IMAP Account
IMAPStore soham.chatterjee@tifr.res.in-remote
Host tifr.res.in
Port 993
User soham.chatterjee@tifr.res.in
PassCmd "pass tifr"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN
SystemCertificates yes

# Local Maildir store
MaildirStore soham.chatterjee@tifr.res.in-local
Subfolders Verbatim
Path /Users/soham/.mail/tifr/
Inbox /Users/soham/.mail/tifr/INBOX

# Sync channel
Channel soham.chatterjee@tifr.res.in
Expunge Both
Far :soham.chatterjee@tifr.res.in-remote:
Near :soham.chatterjee@tifr.res.in-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
SyncState *
